  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, the runesmith gains a +1 luck bonus to saving throws against spells and abilities with a writing motif, such as <em>symbol of death</em>, <em>symbol of insanity</em>, <em>sepia snake sigil</em>, and <em>explosive runes</em>. In addition, if a spell with a writing motif normally allows no saving throw, then the runesmith is entitled to a Will save to stare the spell down and negate it. If the runesmith is the only individual who would be affected by a spell that he negates in this manner, the spell retroactively fails to trigger, and cannot trigger upon the runesmith again for 24 hours. At 13th level, this luck bonus improves to +2.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmith#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
